  "ingredients": [
    "3.5 pounds apples, cored and diced",
    "3 cups water, or as needed",
    "7.5 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 teaspoon butter",
    "1 (2 ounce) package powdered fruit pectin"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2TY82uc1nky7YVbKeoApaTLf9ew=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-01-0e614b9d31bb478faa7dc83cdf1d7da3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place apples in a large pot; cover with water. Bring to a boil; reduce heat, cover, and simmer until apples are slightly tender, about 5 minutes. Crush cooked apples and simmer for 5 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rudt3oAq9be3BWD4lPwxB_UyVdM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-02-f9098a9ee0b34e30a1bfdabc2b1682dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer crushed apples to a sieve or cheesecloth. Let drip into a bowl until all liquid has drained, pressing gently to release all the juice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/axSV9xFXK3kxdTfhFeRy4ow-Tbs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-03-b5a264da7e89402abc5007eb1b8551ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure 5 cups apple juice, adding water if necessary to have the exact amount. Stir sugar into juice; add butter to reduce foaming.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ilV9V6G8X-KElLT418pmWEJMcq0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-04-b327e2c300ed4b58959c0e0e77515ed1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring juice mixture to a rolling boil, stirring constantly. Stir in pectin; boil for exactly 1 minute to dissolve pectin, stirring constantly. Remove from heat. Skim off excess foam with a metal spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/85Ajmlm6aNnvLvTKjWf9ge0SINE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-05-1ab9a88881a74661a5bcb1fc74d4667a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sterilize the jars and lids in boiling water for at least 5 minutes. Ladle apple jam into the hot, sterilized jars, filling the jars to within 1/8 inch of the top. Run a knife or a thin spatula around the insides of the jars after they have been filled to remove any air bubbles. Wipe the rims of the jars with a moist paper towel to remove any food residue. Top with lids, and screw on rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LQrU1Yh3QZeEw6Sgo0IpixwPE4M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-06-debf9360cfb64ab58d3337c3b848b9fd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil and lower jars into the boiling water using a holder. Leave a 2-inch space between the jars. Pour in more boiling water if necessary to bring the water level to at least 1 inch above the tops of the jars. Bring the water to a rolling boil, cover the pot, and process for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gwnB5bZvmOyNiZ3h8HzvK4wbd2A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-07-e5aae82db6b440fa97c0c631e7444d81.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully remove the jars from the stockpot and place onto a cloth-covered or wood surface, several inches apart, until cool. Once cool, press the top of each lid with a finger, ensuring that the seal is tight (lids do not move up or down at all). Let stand at room temperature for 24 hours. Store in a cool, dark area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hMtxqTq9mUVMqIdQSlbTRetOn28=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228810-apple-jelly-VAT-step-08-df6e853c82b74e13adb237b2577100ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228810/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
